{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-05-02 10:30:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS BRINGS TWO AIR SEPARATION UNITS ONSTREAM FOR WORLD-LEADING SEMICONDUCTOR MANUFACTURER IN ASIA', 'text': "LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , MAY 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT AIR PRODUCTS SAN FU CO. LTD RECENTLY BROUGHT TWO NEW AIR SEPARATION UNITS ONSTREAM, AS PART OF THE LONG-TERM AGREEMENTS TO PROVIDE ULTRA-HIGH PURITY INDUSTRIAL GASES TO ONE OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST SEMICONDUCTOR MANUFACTURERS IN ASIA."}